          "text": "Intel's ordering name is \"Intel® Arc™ B580 Limited Edition Graphics, box\"; ARK lists this card's board data as \"Intel Reference Card Attributes\"."
        },
        {
          "field": "heightMm",
          "text": "Intel gives \"Dimensions (Length x Width)\" as \"272 x 115 mm\"; the width (card height from the slot) is recorded as heightMm."
