        {
          "field": "outputs",
          "text": "Intel's public pages give the output types, not their counts: ARK lists \"Graphics Output\" \"HDMI* 2.1, DP2.1 up to UHBR 13.5, DP2.1 up to UHBR 10\" and \"# of Displays Supported\" \"4\", and the Desktop Quick Start Guide (support article 000091128) lists DP 2.1 and \"HDMI 2.1a\" ports. The counts, \"3x DP 2.1\" and \"1x HDMI 2.1\", are from the Quick Reference Guide."
